					<Content>﻿<?ACE 4?>	Priyanka Shankar, ‘Can Elon Musk’s Starlink Provide Internet Service to Gaza?’ Al Jazeera, 29 October 2023, https://www.aljazeera.com/ news/2023/10/29/can-elon-musks-starlink-provide-internet-service-to-gaza (accessed 15 November 2023).﻿</Content>
				</EndnoteRange>
